  "description": "Access your Astravue workspace directly from Claude to search, create, and\nupdate tasks, projects, and spaces. Track overdue work, review blockers and\ndependencies, log time, manage checklists and comments, and get a live view\nof team workload without leaving the conversation.\n\nEvery request runs with your own Astravue permissions, so Claude sees exactly\nwhat you see — nothing more. Write actions are explicit and scoped to the\nwork items you name.\n\nInteractive task and project views open inline for review before you act.\nComplements your Astravue workspace with tools spanning tasks, subtasks,\ndependencies, custom fields, statuses, tags, time tracking, saved filters,\nand workspace members — alongside the workflows your team already uses.",
